    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "id": "poke_get_15_03",
      "hash": "cc7ed1fc6968ded6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR NUM7(0000,0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "id": "poke_get_20_01",
      "hash": "70e77c2ff37a8258",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR NUM3(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "id": "poke_get_20_02",
      "hash": "70e77f2ff37a8771",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR ITEM2(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "id": "poke_get_25_01",
      "hash": "a28cf059acb43a29",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "连续捕获　[VAR NUM3(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "id": "poke_get_40_01",
      "hash": "f3d3d054a2eb0b0a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：[VAR POKNAME(0000)]\\n竟然会来到这里，\\r\\n真是少见！\\c\\n不过既然来了……\\n你就练习一下\\r\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]捕捉宝可梦[VAR COLOR(0000)]吧！\\c\\n向着宝可梦扔出\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]精灵球[VAR COLOR(0000)]去捕捉它吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "id": "poke_get_40_02",
      "hash": "f3d3cf54a2eb0957",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：看来有点困难呢！\\n我再给你一些精灵球，\\r\\n你继续去试试看吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "id": "poke_get_50_01",
      "hash": "67046c5e742075ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "请对着画面中的精灵球\\n笔直地握住Joy-Con。"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "id": "poke_get_50_02",
      "hash": "6704695e742070d4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "笔直地握好后，\\n按A键做好“准备”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "id": "poke_get_50_03",
      "hash": "67046a5e74207287",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "挥动Joy-Con投掷精灵球。"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "id": "poke_get_50_04",
      "hash": "6704675e74206d6e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看准圆圈投掷吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "id": "poke_get_50_05",
      "hash": "6704685e74206f21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "挥动Joy-Con时\\n请注意周围的环境！"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "id": "poke_get_60_01",
      "hash": "d78b089360342284",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "双手好好握住后，\\n按A键做好“准备”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "id": "poke_get_60_02",
      "hash": "d78b0b936034279d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "准备扔球时可以通过\\n移动主机来查看四周。"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "id": "poke_get_60_03",
      "hash": "d78b0a93603425ea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "按A键往画面中央扔出精灵球。"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "id": "poke_get_60_04",
      "hash": "d78b059360341d6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看准圆圈投掷吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "id": "poke_get_60_05",
      "hash": "d78b049360341bb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "难以看清目标或移动困难时，\\n请按B键返回。"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "id": "poke_get_70_01",
      "hash": "1d1727bc4a7b69a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "操作方法发生改变。\\n将重新开始。"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "id": "poke_get_80_01",
      "hash": "b4ecb8880ddd1d76",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "操作发生改变。\\n要查看说明吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "id": "poke_get_80_02",
      "hash": "b4ecb7880ddd1bc3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要查看投掷精灵球的\\n操作说明吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "id": "poke_get_80_03",
      "hash": "b4ecb6880ddd1a10",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可以从“包包”中\\n选择树果使用！"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "id": "poke_get_80_04",
      "hash": "b4ecbd880ddd25f5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "如果把球投进会动的圆圈中，\\n就有机会出现“漂亮一投”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "id": "poke_get_80_05",
      "hash": "b4ecbc880ddd2442",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "当圆圈越变越小时，\\n就是你获得更佳投掷的机会！"
    }
  ],
